# Phase 7 demo requests (docs/plans/phase-7.md). Most of Phase 7 is seen in the portal (Live tab, offline scanner,
# Admin · Dead letters) and in Mailpit (http://localhost:8025). These are the APIs behind it.
# Run with the VS Code REST Client or IntelliJ's HTTP client, top to bottom. Start with Mailpit and Redis up
# (docker compose), and every service including notification-service (README "Quick start").

@gw = http://localhost:8080

### --- log in ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name organizer
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "organizer.a@mitpass.test", "password": "Passw0rd!"}

###
# @name volunteer
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "volunteer@mitpass.test", "password": "Passw0rd!"}

###
